Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qualcomm Sensor Core client library
 Reads the sensors behind the Qualcomm Sensor Core (SSC) on the DSP over
 QMI: accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer, light and proximity.

